@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam nodesep 45
skinparam ranksep 50
title Shape 行为多态与 ShapeProvider 扩展边界（非 Adapter 模式）

class ShapeFactory {
  -entries: Map
  +register(provider)
  -entry(typeKey): checked entry
  +create(typeKey, id, args): Shape
  +fromSvg(id, element, children): Shape
  +inspect(shape): ShapeView
  +toSvgElement(shape): SvgElementData
}
interface "ShapeProvider<T extends Shape>" as ShapeProvider {
  +accepts(shape): shape is T
  +create(id, args): T
  +fromSvg(id, element, children): T
  +inspect(shape: T): ShapeView
  +toSvgElement(shape: T): SvgElementData
}
class RectProvider
class CircleProvider
class ShapeQueryService {
  +tree(document, id)
  +show(document, id)
}
interface TreePrinter
class TreeFormatter
class ShowFormatter
class ShapeView <<readonly data>>
class SvgWriter {
  +write(document): string
}
class SvgReader
abstract class Shape {
  +move(dx, dy)
  +scale(factor)
  +setAttribute(name, value)
  +clone(): Shape
  +asContainer(): ContainerShape or null
  +只读领域数据
}
class RectShape
class CircleShape
abstract class ContainerShape {
  +只读 children
  +asContainer(): this
}
class GroupShape

ShapeFactory o--> ShapeProvider : 唯一类型映射 D2
RectProvider ..|> ShapeProvider : T = RectShape
CircleProvider ..|> ShapeProvider : T = CircleShape
RectProvider --> RectShape : 构造 / 只读访问
CircleProvider --> CircleShape : 构造 / 只读访问
RectShape --|> Shape
CircleShape --|> Shape
ContainerShape --|> Shape
GroupShape --|> ContainerShape
ShapeQueryService --> ShapeFactory : inspect
TreeFormatter ..|> TreePrinter
TreePrinter ..> ShapeView : 树打印协议
TreeFormatter ..> ShapeView : 默认树排版
ShowFormatter ..> ShapeView : 单节点排版
ShapeQueryService ..> ShapeView : 构建只读结果
SvgWriter --> ShapeFactory : toSvgElement
SvgReader --> ShapeFactory : fromSvg

note left of ShapeFactory
  EditorRuntime 注册六个内置 Provider
  后续新增类型增加对应 Provider 与注册项
  不在输出器另建类型映射
  配对守卫通过后才调用 Provider
end note
note right of GroupShape
  move / scale 递归委派给子图形
  叶子没有 addChild 操作
  领域行为不交给 Provider
end note
note right of CircleProvider
  其余四种内置类型结构相同
  展示摘要与 SVG 属性映射在外层
  领域类不依赖 Provider
end note
@enduml
